ntage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.319,"playId":"401862813360","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.2862,"playId":"401862813364","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.2793,"playId":"401862813371","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.2704,"playId":"401862813377","tiePercentage":0}],"gameInfo":{"venue":{"id":"4418","guid":"9649d68e-8698-30d5-8999-5508cacacc4f","fullName":"Jerry Richardson Stadium","address":{"city":"Charlotte","state":"NC","zipCode":"28223","country":"USA"},"grass":false,"images":[{"href":"https://a.espncdn.com/i/venues/college-football/day/interior/4418.jpg","width":2000,"height":1125,"alt":"","rel":["full","day","interior"]}]},"attendance":8106},"article":{"headline":"Tulane rallies from 10-point deficit, beats Charlotte 38-31 in OT","description":"— Johnnie Daniels had 99 yards rushing and two touchdowns, TJ Smith returned a kickoff 95 yards for a touchdown and Tulane rallied from a 10-point fourth-quarter deficit to beat Charlotte 38-31 in overtime on Friday night.","story":"CHARLOTTE, N.C. -- — <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5218820/johnnie-daniels\" target=\"_new\">Johnnie Daniels</a> had 99 yards rushing and two touchdowns, <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5225883/tj-smith\" target=\"_new\">TJ Smith</a> returned a kickoff 95 yards for a touchdown and Tulane rallied from a 10-point fourth-quarter deficit to beat Charlotte 38-31 in overtime on Friday night. \n\n\r\n              Short-yardage quarterback <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5219709/dagan-bruno\" target=\"_new\">Dagan Bruno</a> lunged for a short TD on fourth-and-goal on the first possession in overtime. Charlotte a first-and-goal at the 4, but after two short runs yielded just 1 yard, <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/4801306/conner-harrell\" target=\"_new\">Conner Harrell</a> threw back-to-back incomplete passes to end it. \n\n\r\n              <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5228760/derrick-eley\" target=\"_new\">Derrick Eley</a> had a 1-yard rushing TD that gave Charlotte a 31-21 lead with 10:52 remaining in the fourth quarter. <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5257395/cooper-helmke\" target=\"_new\">Cooper Helmke</a> made a 27-yard field goal about 4 1/2 minutes later and <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5291713/trace-johnson\" target=\"_new\">Trace Johnson</a> threw an 11-yard touchdown pass to <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5079686/bredell-richardson\" target=\"_new\">Bredell Richardson</a> with 10 seconds left that made it 31-all. \n\n\r\n              Charlotte (1-7, 1/3 American Conference) beat Temple <a href=\"https://apnews.com/article/charlotte-temple-score-1208d920f29179e234a524d4028c17f7\">38-31</a> on Oct. 17 to snap a 14-game losing streak (dating to last season) overall and a 10-game skid in conference play. \n\n\r\n              Johnson was 28-of-36 passing for 284 yards with a touchdown and an interception for Tulane (4-4, 2-2). \n\n\r\n              <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/4879655/henry-rutledge\" target=\"_new\">Henry Rutledge</a> had 121 yards rushing on a season-high 22 carries for Charlotte. <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5148741/khamani-alexander\" target=\"_new\">Khamani Alexander</a> scored on a 44-yard run. \n\n\r\n              Harrell threw a 22-yard touchdown pass to <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5153730/jaden-barnes\" target=\"_new\">Jaden Barnes</a> with 4:01 left in the second quarter. After a Tulane punt, Eley caught a 16-yard TD pass from Harrell that capped an eight-play, 80-yard drive and gave the 49ers a 24-14 at halftime. \n\n\r\n              The teams each had 437 total yards in regulation. \n\n\r\n              <hl2>Up next</hl2>\r\n              Tulane: Host Tulsa on Nov. 7. \n\n\r\n              Charlotte: Visits UAB on Nov. 7. \n\n\r\n              ------\n\n\r\n              <a href=\"https://apnews.com/newsletters\">Sign up for Top 25 poll alerts here</a>, visit <a href=\"https://apnews.com/hub/ap-top-25-college-football-poll\">the Top 25 here</a> and see AP’s full <a href=\"https://apnews.com/hub/college-football\">college football coverage here</a>","published":"2026-10-31T03:16:45Z"}}